    emailTxt: "Subject: A friendly nudge on your invoice\n\nHi there, just a gentle reminder that invoice {{invoiceNumber}} for {{kinName}}'s care ({{amount}}) is still open.\n\nWhenever you get a chance to take care of it, I'd appreciate it. Thank you so much.\n\nWith care, Auntie\n\nTribe Tails Pet Care. Your Kin's Favorite Auntie.\n",
