    emailTxt: "Subject: Got a minute? I'd love your take\n\nHi there, I'm always trying to make Tribe Tails better for you and your Kin, and your honest take helps more than you know.\n\nIf you've got a minute, I'd really value your feedback.\n\nThank you, Auntie\n\nTribe Tails Pet Care. Your Kin's Favorite Auntie.\n",
